{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "standing": "PROPOSED S10-TSC (M3-B r8 item 14a, successor S10): the public detail registry as the union of its two accepted lines plus native.typescript-config-unresolved and its four context-free internal aliases; the closed enum design mirror; complete successor copies of both native-model files (SD-7 line 1159 applied) with one D9_MAP row (request-rejected, exit 2, CONFIG.INVALID) and one PUBLIC_ROUTE_REMEDIES entry keyed by the public detail; the product vocabulary (common v1/v3/v4, regenerated contracts), the re-pinned admission registry, and the remedy product carrier (crates/host/src/outcomes.rs). SELECTION: this unit's registry, design mirror and two model copies become the selected copies; every later edit of PUBLIC_ROUTE_REMEDIES, D9_MAP or the registry succeeds these, not their parents. No passage override; no TypeScript resolution, D9 class/code/exit change or qualification",
